From c3a20737ec96bd4f8ff11fb2af8206700dc9f65e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Chong <achong@meta.com>
Date: Mon, 4 Aug 2025 09:56:03 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] enable libwebm_mkvmuxer on darwin

Summary:
# Motivation:
libwebm_mkvmuxer  is needed for cuttlefish host utils webrtc:
# Overview:
- enable libwebm_mkvmuxer

Test Plan:
```
. build/envsetup.sh
 lunch aosp_cf_arm64_phone-userdebug
 m out/host/darwin-x86/cvd-host_package.tar.gz -k &> ~/build.logs.txt
```
---
 Android.bp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index b68d2dd..cfc9ba1 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -53,7 +53,7 @@ cc_library {
     min_sdk_version: "29",
     target: {
         darwin: {
-            enabled: false,
+            enabled: true,
         },
     },
 }
